# Promotion: Sergeant (ahtUrhgan 94): a level 1 Warrior with the promotions up to Corporal completed (so Naja
# offers no earlier one) and the C Wildcat Badge,
# AssaultPromotion 25, a Bowl of Sutlac and a Bone Chip. Whitegate: Naja Salaheem (no script, no default), trigger area
# 10 (-89 0 -8 .. -71 0 8: a floor at y 0). Nashmau: trigger area 1 (0 0 -50 .. 20 0 -35), Totoroon (no script; default
# 246). Caedarva Mire: qm11 (no script, no default). Available: Naja 5055, finished with option 1: not begun; again,
# option 0: begun. Prog 0: Naja 5058; again in the zone: once per zone: nothing; area 10: 5056, option 1: nothing; out
# and in: 5056, option 0: Prog 1. Prog 1 (the warp to area 10 was a zone-in: the marks cleared): Naja 5058; again:
# nothing (one mark, the lookup's local var by NPC, handler and csid, covers every Prog's 5058). Nashmau's area 1: day >
# Stage 0: 303, option 3 (not 2): Stage = tomorrow; out and in: nil; a day on (day = Stage): nil; two days on: 303,
# option 2: Prog 2. Prog 2: Whitegate: Naja 5058, again nothing; Nashmau again: Totoroon 252; a trade of the Sutlac and
# the chip: not exactly: nil: nothing; the Sutlac alone: 304, finished: taken, Prog 3. Whitegate (a new zone-in: the
# mark gone): Naja at Prog 3: 5058, again nothing. Caedarva: qm11 20: Prog 4. Whitegate: Naja 5057, finished: completed
# (the S Wildcat Badge, Sergeant), AssaultPromotion 0, PROMOTION_SERGEANT, the C badge taken. bob (Corporal completed,
# AssaultPromotion 24): nothing; carl (AssaultPromotion 25, Corporal not completed: Lance Corporal accepted, so no
# promotion offered): nothing.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Naja_Salaheem/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/onTriggerAreaEnter/10 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/5055 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/5056 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/5057 Nashmau/onTriggerAreaEnter/1 Nashmau/onEventFinish/303 Nashmau/Totoroon/onTrigger Nashmau/Totoroon/onTrade Nashmau/onEventFinish/304 CaedarvaMire/qm11/onTrigger
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=24.2,-7.804,-45.591 job=WAR lvl=1
char bob zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=24.2,-7.804,-45.591 job=WAR lvl=1
char carl zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=24.2,-7.804,-45.591 job=WAR lvl=1
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionPrivateFirstClass completed
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionSuperiorPrivate completed
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionLanceCorporal completed
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionCorporal completed
charvar AssaultPromotion 25
keyitem CWildcatBadge
item BowlOfSutlac
item BoneChip
bob: quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionCorporal completed
bob: charvar AssaultPromotion 24
